<title>CANADA: Bank of Montreal Q4 net climbs 7.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Montreal Q4 net climbs 7.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>fourth quarter ended Oct. 31</p>
<p>				 1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.04		   C$0.93</p>
<p> Net			291,000		  269,000</p>
<p> Assets	     169,832,000	    151,834,000</p>
<p> Deposits	   119,262,000	    109,605,000</p>
<p> Loans		 98,413,000	     88,442,000</p>
<p>			12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$4.13		   C$3.38</p>
